{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1272048-the-eighth-annual-exalted-white-elephant","id":1272048,"title":"The EIGHTH Annual Exalted White Elephant","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-11-30T15:01:45-08:00","id":1272048,"title":"The EIGHTH Annual Exalted White Elephant","content":"Hello all! The yuletide approaches, so that means it's once again time for one of our annual traditions, the Exalted White Elephant! As always the rules are simple:<br /> <br /> (1) To sign up, post in this topic saying that you want to participate. Please be clear on this! I don't want anyone to miss out because I thought someone was signing up when they weren't or vice versa!<br /> <br /> (2) When you post that you're signing up, please share a couple ideas of what you'd like to receive, or at least post some things you particularly like about the game/setting! It makes things a lot easier for your gift giver to get started if they have an idea of what you'll enjoy.<br /> <br /> (3) Sign-ups will be open until 2200 PST on Thursday, Dec. 6th (That's 0600 UTC on Friday the 7th for all our non-North American members), at which point I will close the sign-ups. After that, I will use my eldritch powers to assign each person who signed up another participant at random, and notify you via PM. You will then make something for this assigned recipient. This can take the form of just about anything, from character right ups, Artifacts, and NPCs to Martial Arts Styles, Settings, character art or short stories! The point is for it to cost you nothing but your time and creative effort to produce something for your recipient; do what you can! <br /> <br /> (4) Once you know who you are giving your gift to, you will have a couple of weeks to produce something for them. Starting around Christmas, if you're finished, post your gift with &quot;White Elephant for X&quot;, where X is your recipient, in the title. However, the holidays are a hectic time, so the due date is Sunday, January 6th. This should give you a month to get your gift ready. Please have your gift posted by then! I understand that life life sometimes gets in the way of things, and that's alright. If it looks like you'll miss the due date, please just let me or your recipient know you'll be a bit late. <br /> <br /> And there we go! Happy gift-giving!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T15:05:00-08:00","id":1272050,"title":"","content":"And of course, I'll be participating! I'm particularly fond of Sidereals, especially in their role as Creation's premier Martial Artists. So anything related to either Sidereals or Martial Arts, like Divine or Demonic Martial Artists/Dojos, legends of lost styles and techniques, or Martial organizations, for example, would be neat. I also like behemoths, kaiju, hekatonkhires, and other nasty monsters. If you're artistically adept, character art would be awesome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T15:26:29-08:00","id":1272053,"title":"","content":"I'll toss my hat into the ring as well. I love giant monsters of all stripes, along with Lunars and Faeries.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T16:24:23-08:00","id":1272071,"title":"","content":"I'm in!<br /> <br /> I usually make art for this, or settings to put in folks' games.<br /> <br /> In terms of stuff for me...I am running a House of Bells game starting in mid January, so stuff for that would be super helpful: student organizations, NPC teachers, custom artifacts or martial arts styles with some historical connection to the school, hazings or student traditions...stuff like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T19:12:53-08:00","id":1272102,"title":"","content":"I would love to participate, but I will be traveling and unable to post until late January. So regrettably, I will be out this year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T20:59:56-08:00","id":1272114,"title":"","content":"I've been waiting for the opportunity to make a new artifact. Let's do this.<br /> <br /> As it stands, at some point next-year-ish I'm going to be playing in a game set in the West. I'd like a location or a character I can weave into my character's backstory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-01T04:32:05-08:00","id":1272147,"title":"","content":"Add my name! I like demons, Malfeas, weird things of prehuman origins! Anything of that sort!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-01T06:10:52-08:00","id":1272164,"title":"","content":"I'm in. <br /> <br /> I draw, but not very well. <br /> <br /> I write, but not very well, either. <br /> <br /> As for what I'd like, I'd fucking love some art of my Twilight character, Spider. Failing that, a story with him featuring prominently would be nice.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Spider is a stylish black man in the prime of his youth. His body, clad in stylish silks that show off more than a little bit of it, is not muscled, as he is not a fighter. His eyes are yellow, and so he wears clothes to match, and has six amber studs piercing his eyebrows. He is energetic and pleasant, and wears the sword Distaff at his side. <br /> <br /> As I said, he's a Twilight Caste; his Anima banner is a gleaming tapestry of ephemeral threads depicting many worlds connected by golden gates.<br /> <br /> Spider is a loremaster, but he's also a sorcerer and a craftsman. He once spent a year and a day as a spider as punishment for reading from a god's book of spells, but he came away from it with an abiding love for working silk. <br /> <br /> If you have any other queries about him, don't hesitate to PM me.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 12-05-2018, 09:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-01T16:11:05-08:00","id":1272250,"title":"","content":"I'm in.<br /> I'd like something sorcery-related - spells, initiations, art of a sorcerer doing cool sorcerous things, that general range","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty","name":"autXautY","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-02T01:48:00-08:00","id":1272340,"title":"","content":"I'm in!<br /> <br /> I can write passably well, but cannot draw anything better than doodles.<br /> <br /> My Twilight is a treasure hunter, so I'd love to get an artifact for her to find or a ruin for her to explore. Alternatively, some art about her or anything about Sidereals, Raksha or Malfeas is very welcome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24320-taleksi","name":"Taleksi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24320_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-02T08:47:35-08:00","id":1272393,"title":"","content":"I'm in!<br /> <br /> My next game will be a Dragon-Blooded campaign, starting in secondary school, and going through the character's sabbatical and beyond. So, anything that could go with that would be awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-02T14:11:20-08:00","id":1272458,"title":"","content":"I'll participate! I can't draw worth anything, but I'm always up for writing. As for the gift, my favorite kind of Exalted are the Lunars. Anything to do with my favorite moon-monsters makes me happy, so go wild under the silver light of Mother Luna!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13696-knurlurzhad","name":"Knurlurzhad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13696_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-04T14:02:15-08:00","id":1272885,"title":"","content":"Hi all! Just a bit over two days left to sign up!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1272048-the-eighth-annual-exalted-white-elephant?p=1272164#post1272164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for what I'd like, I'd fucking love some art of my Twilight character, Spider. Failing that, a story with him featuring prominently would be nice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey Alucard- would you mind putting something up about this character, so your gift-giver has some information to work on? Want to make sure that your gift is related to your character, not some unrelated Twilight who happens to also be neamed Spider after all!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-04T20:54:40-08:00","id":1272927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1272048-the-eighth-annual-exalted-white-elephant?p=1272885#post1272885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey Alucard- would you mind putting something up about this character, so your gift-giver has some information to work on? Want to make sure that your gift is related to your character, not some unrelated Twilight who happens to also be neamed Spider after all!</div> </div> </div> </div>Edited my first post with some visual details, will add some more stuff shortly. Thanks for reminding me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-05T13:21:20-08:00","id":1273009,"title":"","content":"I'm in. I'll likely do an artifact or location for whoever gets me as their gift giver.<br /> <br /> If an artist gets me, I would enjoy character art (specifics to follow later). If not, I'd like a neat artifact 2 gadget, something not powerful, that had a use in the First Age and might have an alternate use today. Alternately, an interesting place in the Scavenger Lands or Hundred Kingdoms or a weird First Age Ruin. Something Lunar related would be fine too.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-05T23:31:32-08:00","id":1273060,"title":"","content":"Hi all- Last day to sign up for this year\u2019s White Elephant!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T02:10:21-08:00","id":1273066,"title":"","content":"I'd like to sign up. I can write and numbers.<br /> <br /> I'm a big fan of forbidden lore, old or new, and especially interested by Realm/Immaculate experiments, that behind-closed-doors captured Anathema stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T04:09:10-08:00","id":1273070,"title":"","content":"Was gonna give this a skip this year as I\u2019ll be travelling but I\u2019ll have access to net and writing stuff so. Yeah sure. I\u2019ll throw my hat in.<br /> <br /> As for what I\u2019d appreciate... umm...<br /> <br /> Louis Laville was a doctor living in Capstone and Darkheart; while his family was wealthy and he was due a noble title, he had rejected that life when a vicious plague ripped through the city and killed his parents and left his younger sister an invalid. <br /> <br /> He later Exalted as a twilight - i\u2019d like to hear a story about how that happened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":2721,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","user":"Elkovash","date":". 12-06-2018, 07:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T07:43:50-08:00","id":1273097,"title":"","content":"I need a (another) project, so I'm in!<br /> <br /> <b>What I Like:</b> I am only recently getting into Exalted, so I am something of a novice when it comes to the deeper lore of the setting, but I already have a number of character and npc ideas. I like seeing my ideas interpreted and extrapolated by artists, so drawings, painting and illustrations are always excellent.<br /> <br /> <b>What I Can Do:</b> Some writing (typically short flavor sections), some game design (still learning how to design for Exalted), and some art ( probably best at characters).<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T11:40:35-08:00","id":1273122,"title":"","content":"I'll join in (keeping in mind that I'm not an artist).<br /> <br /> Got to be 100% clear this time... I would like a write-up for a fallen Great House. Go for one that hasn't been given a name yet, and write it from the perspective of when it was still alive; that is to say, set earlier in the timeline than RY 768*. It can be at whatever stage takes the fancy of the writer: brand new, in its heyday, on the verge of falling, whichever. It doesn't need to be as detailed as the write-ups in What Fire Has Wrought, but preferably would have the structure; it doesn't need to have more detailed territories than its headquarters, or personages than its founder, but those ones are kind of essential.<br /> <br /> * Unless one has a <i>really</i> nifty idea for where it could fit in an alternative landscape for the Time of Tumult.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T13:12:38-08:00","id":1273136,"title":"","content":"I didn\u00b4t write my entry last year, and I am really sorry for that. I was in a terrible time, and didn\u00b4t do something that I should <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> This year, I am in a better moment of my life, and will try to do my best.<br /> <br /> If I am allowed to participate, I would like something related to Martial Arts. A cool mentor, a new Style, an interesting idea for a Dojo, whatever. If Martial Arts are not your thing, something that I may use in my Western campaign could be cool. An island, some aquatic monster or volcano god, a map (maps are cool. How am I suppossed to do pirate stuff without maps?), some nautical spell, the crew of deadly Lintha pirate... Whatever!<br /> <br /> I can\u00b4t draw. I am unable to draw anything more complex than a &quot;slightly round circle&quot; and even then it will be an horrible, horrible circle. And I\u00b4m not good with fiction, specially in English, which isn\u00b4t my first language. But I think I can handle the mechanics, and can have some interesting ideas for lore, so I can make these things. Locations, NPCs, spells, artifacts or monsters I can handle. Just don\u00b4t ask me to draw them!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T13:39:32-08:00","id":1273142,"title":"","content":"I'm in.<br /> <br /> I'll take character art greedily enough, particularly of either of the DBs I have closest to the top of the queue, but the real prize would be someone willing to take the sketchy notes I have of their signature artifacts and turn them into something usable. (...Now I just need to <i>find</i> those notes...)<br /> <br /> I can produce setting material or fiction.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: OK, so. Found one of them:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">[12:06 AM] Me: Concept wise, I'm thinking that it's got themes of dueling, afterimages, and lightning.<br /> [12:09 AM] Other Player: I think DB stealth has some afterimage charms you could look at for that<br /> [12:10 AM] Me: I'll take a look.<br /> [12:10 AM] Me: I'd originally been mentally-speculating on doing something with flurry mechanics, but that might well be more promising.<br /> [12:11 AM] Me: (In the 'wielder does one thing, afterimage does another - with both effects happening')<br /> [12:12 AM] Other Player: that could still work. afterimages is a fairly broad idea<br /> [12:12 AM] Me: Yeah.<br /> [12:12 AM] Me: Penultimate or capstone is the only charm I have a solid image for.<br /> [12:13 AM] Me: Which is drawing a dueling circle in curtains of lightning, isolating the wielder and a particular target.<br /> [12:13 AM] Me: Crossing the ring in either direction, BZAAP<br /> [12:14 AM] Other Player: nice. the idea of lightning as punishment for going outside the conduct of the dual could be something you carry through the whole tree<br /> [12:15 AM] Me: Yes, yes it would.</span><br /> <br /> This PC is deliberately inspired by my enjoyment of Burroughs John Carter stories, so the physical sword itself, the blue jade reaper daiklave Winter Lightning, is more of a saber type blade than is usual in the setting. He also owns that Creation's version of Summer Thunder, so I was thinking in terms of thematic contrast, there.<br /> <br /> I <i>haven't</i> been able to find anything for what I'd be doing with my other DB. It's possible I'm misremembering and I never even got to the stage of formal ideas for her. She's a Fire Aspect from a very prominent family in House Cathak, with all the attendant pressure towards military excellence that implies, but her own inclinations are, in increasing order, towards administration, socialite stuff, and dance. I picture her artifact being a set of very beefy Stompy Battle Boots to go with otherwise light armor, and acrobatic, kick focused fighting like those twirly upside-down Capoeira kicks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","user":"Valles","date":". 12-07-2018, 07:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T14:04:22-08:00","id":1273145,"title":"","content":"I'm in.<br /> <br /> <b>What I like:</b> gods, elementals, starmetal artifacts, demesnes, manses, and character art<br /> <br /> <b>What I can do:</b> QCs (not very good at demons though), artifacts, demesnes, manses, thaumaturgy, charms, setting material","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5376,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","user":"AtG","date":". 12-06-2018, 05:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T16:09:20-08:00","id":1273168,"title":"","content":"I'll join in<br /> <br /> What I like: Character-focused stories such as little bits about how people actually live their lives in a magical world, or writeups of some of the more bizarre aspects of Creation<br /> <br /> What I can do: Mechanics of all sorts, especially Evocation Trees. I am also good at Weird Magic fiction","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/776-saintedphysician","name":"SaintedPhysician","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T16:46:47-08:00","id":1273171,"title":"","content":"I'm in~<br /> <br /> What I like: Character art, spirits (particularly demons), artifacts, Charms, QCs.<br /> <br /> What I can do: Mechanical stuff. Artifacts, QCs (Demons, particularly), Charms, weirder stuff. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair","name":"Alistair","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23684_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T22:15:25-08:00","id":1273207,"title":"","content":"SIGNUPS ARE NOW CLOSED. I will be assigning recipients shortly, keep an eye on your inbox!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T23:44:40-08:00","id":1273231,"title":"","content":"Alright! Recipients have been assigned and sent out by PM. Let me know if you didn't receive one!<br /> <br /> If you have any questions for your recipient, you can contact them at your discretion. Or, if you prefer to keep yourself anonymous to your recipient, I'll be happy to act as a middleman for communication.<br /> <br /> Remember, <i>ideally </i>gifts will be done on or around Christmas, but the deadline is <b>Sunday January 6th</b>. If something comes up and you won't be able to meet that deadline, please let me and/or your recipient know!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-23T14:05:51-08:00","id":1276314,"title":"","content":"I decided I'd get a bit of a jump on things.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1276313-seven-lines-for-seven-islands-white-elephant-for-mockery-part-1\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1276313-seven-lines-for-seven-islands-white-elephant-for-mockery-part-1\"> Seven Lines for Seven Islands (White Elephant for Mockery, part 1) - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1276313-seven-lines-for-seven-islands-white-elephant-for-mockery-part-1\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1276313-seven-lines-for-seven-islands-white-elephant-for-mockery-part-1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In the interest of helping out, here are seven one line western locations. If you tell me which of them you like, Mockery, I'll see what I can do about expanding on those a bit more. Isle of the Invincible Willow - dominated by a giant willow tree, the Alchemist Lords of this satrapy develop new drugs for the Realm. Isle of View - a sacred island said to cause dreams of your destined love. Peleps Chedika has started surveying the island for a Manse. The Siaka&rsquo;s Belly - shark infested coral reef said to be full of jade and pearls. Nigh impossible to sail through. Isle of the Adamant Cliffs - </div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-24T17:34:21-08:00","id":1276544,"title":"","content":"My gift to BrilliantRain.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1276543-white-elephant-for-brilliantrain\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1276543-white-elephant-for-brilliantrain\"> White Elephant for BrilliantRain - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1276543-white-elephant-for-brilliantrain\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1276543-white-elephant-for-brilliantrain </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So BrilliantRain wanted something from a selection of &amp;quot;a neat artifact 2 gadget, something not powerful, that had a use in the First Age and might have an </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-27T00:26:46-08:00","id":1276967,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: White Elephant</b><br /> <br /> This is for <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty\">autXautY</a>, who requested an Initiation. Hopefully this turned out well, since its my first time designing with Exalted.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1qEyeu8UneW159Lpk3bO5vkHOemwI1s_h\" target=\"_blank\">The Essence Weavers Craft</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-27T14:36:13-08:00","id":1277085,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1277078-white-elephant-for-reighnhell-a-night-s-rest-fiction\">For Reighnhell.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-31T02:54:20-08:00","id":1277633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1277624-white-elephant-for-letipex\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1277624-white-elephant-for-letipex\"> White Elephant for LeTipex - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1277624-white-elephant-for-letipex\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1277624-white-elephant-for-letipex </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> As requested, something for a Dragonblooded Secondary School or their Sabbatical. I went with a South Western Satrapy with some neat tourist attractions, and maybe a cult or two. Enjoy LeTipex ! Things to see in Yirji, for the Adventurous Dynast: The tombs of the great kings of Yirji&mdash;and their bodies, preserved against time by the venom of the golden serpents. The golden serpents, wise and cunning snakes that roam the streets freely. Stem the schemes of the Ever Ready Fangs and their criminal enterprises! Learn the secrets of the Kuro sect of mystics! The port of Yirji is guarded </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> For Letipex, a poisonous satrapy","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"